Q: Why can&#39;t I change the rotation of sprites? A: <p><a href="https://stackoverflow.com/a/79891666/6243352">This answer</a> presents working code but has the wrong reason for why the code works. <code>angleMode(DEGREES)</code> is not the fix; it's pinning p5 to the suggested 1.11.4, and adding <code>clear()</code> in the <code>draw()</code> loop to see the sprite.</p>
<p>Ideally, pin all versions, including p5play, so that future releases won't break your app.</p>
<p><div class="snippet" data-lang="js" data-hide="false" data-console="true" data-babel="false" data-babel-preset-react="false" data-babel-preset-ts="false">
<div class="snippet-code">
<pre class="snippet-code-js lang-js prettyprint-override"><code>function setup() {
  // angleMode(DEGREES); &lt;-- irrelevant
  createCanvas(350, 350);
  sprite = new Sprite(100, 100, 150, 75);
  sprite.rotation = 45;
}

// required
function update() {
  clear();
}</code></pre>
<pre class="snippet-code-html lang-html prettyprint-override"><code>&lt;!-- pinned versions --&gt;
&lt;script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/p5@1.11.4/lib/p5.js"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/p5@1.11.4/lib/addons/p5.sound.min.js"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/p5play/3.33.5/planck.min.js"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/p5play/3.33.5/p5play.min.js"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;</code></pre>
</div>
</div>
